        "* **The \"Germany\" Critical Case:** Through geographical visualization, I discovered that the churn rate in Germany is disproportionately high, nearly doubling that of France and Spain. This indicates a localized issue—either due to aggressive competition or a lack of product-market fit in that specific region.\n",
