        "* **High-Quality Client Attrition:** The boxplot analysis confirmed that we are not just losing \"bad\" or low-score customers. Churned individuals share a similar credit profile with those who stay (averaging 650 points), meaning the bank is failing to retain financially healthy profiles.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Inactivity as a Precursor:** With only 51.5% of the database considered \"active,\" I have identified a strong correlation between inactivity and the decision to leave. My hypothesis is that the \"quiet\" loss of engagement is the primary stage before the final churn.\n",
